@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Cloudflare Agents runtime
+
+The registered `AIChatAgent` classes run as Cloudflare Durable Objects. The deployment owner must declare each deployed class in Wrangler Durable Object bindings, add new classes to a SQLite Durable Object migration with `new_sqlite_classes`, supply the model provider binding and credentials in the Worker environment, and deploy Worker code, bindings, and migrations together.
+
+`SupportAgent` builds an open request tool map by spreading runtime-selected tools, so static inspection cannot enumerate its final tools. `StepSupportAgent` can replace instructions in `prepareStep`, so canonical state does not assert an instruction-loader binding. `DelegatingSupportAgent` registers `delegate_support` as an ordinary function tool; its implementation references `StepSupportAgent`, but that reference is not a handoff or routing target.
